        "PMC6981790::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al segregates to the HfNbTaTiZr alloy–oxide interface during oxidation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interfacial Al fosters growth of a thermodynamically stable Al2O3-based layer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9787501::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC6981790::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A continuous protective oxide layer acts as a barrier that inhibits further oxygen ingress.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9787501::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed alumina-rich layer will reduce internal oxidation in Al-modified HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9787501::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slower oxygen ingress will prevent oxidation-induced embrittlement.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to untreated HfNbTaTiZr, the Al-modified alloy will show significantly less oxide-scale formation and better oxygen resistance at 800–1000 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
