        "PMC9787501::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC6981790::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-modified alloy will retain a higher fraction of its baseline room- and elevated-temperature mechanical performance than untreated HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Untreated equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr undergoes severe oxidation, high oxygen uptake, and resulting mechanical degradation in high-temperature air.",
